# Vault issues — daily log

**One local calendar day = one file:** `vault/issues/YYYY-MM-DD.md`

If missing, create from `vault/issues/_template.md` (set date in title).

## When to write

- User says: เก็บลง vault, บันทึกปัญหาวันนี้, save to vault, log this issue
- User explicitly asks to record question/problem/solution for today
- After resolving a non-trivial problem, you may offer once: *"เก็บลง vault/issues วันนี้ไหม?"* — only if helpful

Do **not** vault routine chat. Do **not** replace `/fix-record` for RCA.

## Sections (append under the right heading)

| Section | Use for |
|---------|---------|
| **คำถาม** | questions, unknowns |
| **ปัญหา** | errors, symptoms, blockers |
| **วิธีแก้** | what worked (short commands/links) |
| **อื่นๆ** | notes, ideas, follow-ups |

## Entry format (append only — never delete history)

```markdown
### HH:MM — short title

- **ประเภท:** คำถาม | ปัญหา | วิธีแก้ | อื่นๆ
- **บริบท:** optional
- **รายละเอียด:**
- **สถานะ:** open | resolved | wontfix
- **วิธีแก้:** when applicable
```

## Rules

- **Append only** — no wiping the day's file
- **No secrets** — no passwords, tokens, full connection strings, private keys
- Confirm after write: file path + section + one-line summary
